#   ok   a malformed ledger line is skipped, not fatal
#   ok   record() appends rather than overwriting - a ferry never erases an earlier one
#   ok   record() REFUSES a short sha rather than writing a phantom that blocks the full sha
#   ok   only claim-bearing directories count as artifacts
