#   ok   POSITIVE CONTROL: merging into one sha does not add panes to another
#   ok   a GENUINE duplicate is a no-op and does NOT print the same as a write
#   ok   the merge does NOT move the ferry timestamp - latency stays time-to-FIRST-ferry
#   ok   the merge does NOT change what counts as ferried - the miss rate is untouched
#   ok   a row with no panes at all is tolerated - the epoch row has none
#   ok   a commit AT the ledger epoch is inside the window, not before it
#   ok   median latency is reported in MINUTES
